00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
God sent us to see an invitation.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, God knew that some of us in their heart knew that only God can be a god.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
For Satan's contention that he could be a god was not only blasphemous, it was also wrong,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
because it was not possible for anyone else to function as a god inside a dominion

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and run it perfectly, without disease, without accidents, without problems.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Nobody can do that. (unintelligible). It was a wrong contention.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Being swept in the crowd, I'm gonna tell you about an experiment that some people did.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
In this experiment, I think it was a very simple experiment.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
There's an arrow like this with two heads.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.000
(unintelligible)

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:21.000
And let's take two arrows, one of them has only one point, and the other has two points like that.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Now obviously, this one looks like this one, but this one does not.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:35.000
So, the experiment was to get a group of people that let us agree that this arrow looks like this one.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:45.000
And then, one member of the group was absent, and they said "let us, when he comes in, let's all say that this one looks like this one.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.000
"And then ask him, which one of these two looks like this one?"

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.000
So, what happened?

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:58.000
So, when this fellow came in, they started to ask the question "which one of the two arrows looks like this one?"

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
And the group, one by one, said "this one looks like this one. This one here looks like this one."

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Until they reached the fellow, the projected victim, and they told him, they asked him "which one of these two looks like this one?"

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.000
And he said "this one looks like this one."

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.000
He went along with the, with the crowd.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:27.000
Now, you and I are sure that he knew that this one looked like this one.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.000
In his heart, he knew that this one looked like this one.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:37.000
But he probably said "maybe, they know something I don't know. Maybe, there's a trick here or something."

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.000
So, he went along with the crowd when he said "this one looks like this one."

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.000
This is a real-life experiment.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:51.000
And this is precisely what happened in that Great Feud.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:00.000
So, the angels suggested that all the creatures who did not oppose God's Absolute Authority must be thrown out.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.000
And banished from God's Kingdom.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.000
But because of God's knowledge that this fellow, in his heart, knew

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.000
which the correct answer is, he went along and was swept in the crowd,

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.000
some of us human beings were also swept in the crowd, and we,

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:23.000
we said "yeah, maybe, Satan can do it. Let us see a demonstration."

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.000
So, God wanted to give us a chance. God is Arrahman Arraheem.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.000
He is the Most Merciful.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:42.000
And He did not throw us out of His kingdom because of this crime that we committed, which is in fact the original sin.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:55.000
He wanted to give us another chance to redeem ourselves, to denounce our crime, and to proclaim God's Absolute Authority and uphold it.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.000
But only God can be a god.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:11.000
Okay, this called for, for this second chance, a test was to be done in order for us to go through the same process.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:17.000
In other words, if you, if you kept after this person and say "are you sure that this one looks like this one?"

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000
He will say "yeah, I'm sure."

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:27.000
They will say "come on, think about it. This one has two pointers, but this has only one, but this has two pointers."

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:38.000
He will tell you, if you pressed him, he will say "well, I know that this one looks like this one, but everybody is saying this one looks like this one, so I thought maybe, maybe they know something I don't know."

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.000
So, this is the second chance.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:50.000
For the second chance, we learn from Sura 67 that God created death. There was no death.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.000
God created death.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:05:03.000
All the creatures who did not uphold God's Absolute Authority are given a second chance, including the jinns and the humans

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:14.000
were, were put to death, and they were to be brought into this, this universe, which is the smallest and innermost of seven universes,

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:23.000
to be born into this world, having no recollection whatsoever of the Great Feud, or anything that happened in their first life.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.000
The Quran calls it "the first life." And this is the second life.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.000
No, excuse me, this is the first life after our death.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:38.000
But we are born into this world without any recollection of what happened in the, in the Great Society.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:44.000
And then, we are given a message from God, telling us "you shall uphold God's Absolute Authority."

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:51.000
We must worship only God, and we must know that God is the only One who possesses all power.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.000
And we are also given a message from Satan.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:06.000
Satan tells us "God alone is not enough. There are also other entities that can have power, like Muhammad, or Jesus, or Mary, or Saint Francis, or Imam Hussein."

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.000
I mean, this is what Satan has been pushing.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:16.000
And then, we make a free-will decision to uphold God's Absolute Authority,

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:23.000
or repeat the crimes that we committed in the past, and we say "there can be other entities besides God who are powerful."

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:34.000
In other words, we're given another chance to go back to God's kingdom, or to join Satan's kingdom.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.000
This is why we are here.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.000
This is one of the main reasons for being here.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:51.000
Now, this was the first half of the, of the answer that I talked about yesterday, and I want now to talk about the second half.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:07:00.000
Second half is that, tragically, this being swept in the crowd is happening to, to many of us,

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.000
because the world is mostly oblivious to God.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:11.000
People, those people driving out in the street, they are just going about their business totally oblivious to God.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:18.000
And they don't do anything to, to develop their soul, nourish the, the real person.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.000
They feed their bodies breakfast, lunch, and dinner.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.000
But they totally neglect the real person.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:32.000
They're feeding their bodies, the after-garment, this is the after-garment, and they leave the real person.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.000
And some of us are being swept in the crowd.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.000
We're doing the same thing as they are.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:51.000
And if we decide to believe in God, even believe in God alone, that He alone is worthy of worship,

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:56.000
we don't do enough to develop our soul. because everybody else is not doing anything.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:03.000
So, if one of us is doing only the Morning Prayer, some of us make funny statements like,

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:09.000
"Well, God should be happy I'm doing the Morning Prayer. Look at all those people doing nothing. I'm doing the Morning Prayer every morning."

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.000
But this is, it is not enough.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:20.000
It is again the, it's repeating the mistake, the original mistake, being swept in the crowd.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:27.000
But the Quran teaches us, in order to be saved, to be redeemed, and to go back to God's Kingdom,

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:34.000
we have to set a minimum for our salvation.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:43.000
A minimum amount of, I'm getting to call it gifts now, that we must give ourselves.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:49.000
We, we grew up taking these obligations, like the Five Daily Prayers.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.000
We've, we've grown accustomed to call them duties.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.000
And they, they changed into something like chores.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:11.000
So, somehow Satan succeeded in, in convincing us that these are chores, or duties that we must do for God, in order to be saved.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.000
This is all wrong.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.000
They are not chores.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:21.000
They're not duties or obligations. The Quran teaches that they are gifts from God.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:27.000
And when you do the Five Daily Prayers, God has given you a gift because you deserve it,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:35.000
and because He knew that in your heart, you knew that this one looks like this one, deep in your heart,

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:40.000
even though you said with your mouth that "yes, Satan can do it."

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:48.000
So, He gives you this gift. And we see it in the Quran when the prophet Abraham prays. He says,

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.000
