00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:13.000
Because they are the meals for the real person, five meals a day.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:19.000
All of us were very careful to make sure that "I'm gonna have lunch today" which is not really the case.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:23.000
I'm not gonna have lunch today, I'm gonna give my body lunch today.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:32.000
