00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:40.000
we will be glad, we will be eager to, to feed our souls, just like we are eager to feed our bodies.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.000
So, let me go through this minimum...

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:53.000
This will be the minimum for any believer in order to avoid being swept in the crowd.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.000
This is the Five Contact Prayers.

