[7:156] ... My mercy encompasses all things. ...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.000
This is what God said.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.000
(7:156) وَرَحْمَتِى وَسِعَتْ كُلَّ شَىْءٍۢ

