[2:62] Surely, those who believe, those who are Jewish, the Christians, the converts; anyone who (1) believes in GOD , and (2) believes in the Hereafter, and (3) leads a righteous life, will receive their recompense from their Lord. They have nothing to fear, nor will they grieve.

