00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:10.000
So, the Five Contact Prayers here are the five basic meals for the soul.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:20.000
The Zakat, we thank God for teaching us how to do it right, because everywhere in the Muslim world, they do it wrong.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:29.000
The majority of Muslims in the world, they give the Zakat, if they do, once a year.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:38.000
2.5% of their savings that are one-year-old, about the same (unintelligible).

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.000
But this is what the Quran says, this is what God says.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:48.000
Sura 6, verse 141. God says "you must give the Zakat on the day of harvest."

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:53.000
