00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:31.000
If they are rich, then you go to your relatives, your cousins, your sisters, brothers, nephews, nieces, aunts, uncles.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.000
This is the second category.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:37.000
Number 3, (unintelligible) the orphans.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.000
If you have some orphans, they have no support from a parent or both parents.

