(2:215) وَٱلْمَسَٰكِينِ وَٱبْنِ ٱلسَّبِيلِ

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.000
The poor, any poor (unintelligible) after that.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.000
And the next category is the traveling alien.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:56.000
