00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.000
The following year, you have to give another million dollars. It's not fair.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:30.000
According to the Quran, when you give the million dollars out of the 40 million, you already purified these 40 million. They are yours.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
You are clean. And you no longer have to give Zakat again.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:38.000
According to the so-called Islamic system, you have to give until you're broke.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:42.000
And Zakat (unintelligible) goes on, until you're broke.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.000
(unintelligible)

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.000
2.5%, one time.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.000
From anything when you receive it.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.000
At the time you receive it.

