00:40:21.000 --> 00:40:26.000
Dr. Khalifa: I didn't talk about Hajj here because it's once in a lifetime, but

00:40:26.000 --> 00:40:33.000
people who perform Hajj destroy it by going to the prophet Muhammad's mosque and they go and commit idol worship as a tomb.

00:40:34.000 --> 00:40:35.000
A destroyed Hajj.

