Islam is not Millat (مِّلَّةَ) Muhammad. It is not. He doesn't know that. It's ignorance of the Quran that causes these disasters.

01:29:58.000 --> 01:30:03.000
This religion, Islam, is called throughout the Quran is called Millat Ibrahim (مِّلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ).

01:30:03.000 --> 01:30:07.000
وَقَالُوا۟ كُونُوا۟ هُودًا أَوْ نَصَٰرَىٰ تَهْتَدُوا۟ ۗ قُلْ بَلْ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِیمَ (2:135) حَنِيفًۭا

01:30:08.000 --> 01:30:10.000
(4:125) وَمَنْ أَحْسَنُ دِينًۭا مِّمَّنْ أَسْلَمَ ... مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ

01:30:11.000 --> 01:30:15.000
And then, the Quran says that Muhammad was following Millat Ibrahim (مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِیمَ).

01:30:15.000 --> 01:30:19.000
ثُمَّ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ أَنِ ٱتَّبِعْ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ حَنِيفًۭا ۖ وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ (16:123) ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ

01:30:20.000 --> 01:30:24.000
So, the prophet Muhammad is a follower of Millat Ibrahim (مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِیمَ). The Quran says in many places which he's not aware of

01:30:24.000 --> 01:30:33.000
that the Salat existed before the Quran. Therefore, the things... in Sura 22, the last verse says,

01:30:33.000 --> 01:30:34.000
(22:78) وَجَٰهِدُوا۟ فِى ٱللَّهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهِ

01:30:34.000 --> 01:30:36.000
Strive in the cause of God.

01:30:36.000 --> 01:30:38.000
(22:78) هُوَ ٱجْتَبَىٰكُمْ

01:30:38.000 --> 01:30:39.000
He chose you

01:30:39.000 --> 01:30:41.000
(22:78) وَمَا جَعَلَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِى ٱلدِّينِ مِنْ حَرَجٍۢ

01:30:41.000 --> 01:30:45.000
and did not cause any difficulty in your religion

01:30:45.000 --> 01:30:47.000
(22:78) مِّلَّةَ أَبِيكُمْ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ

01:30:47.000 --> 01:30:49.000
This is the religion of your father Ibrahim.

01:30:49.000 --> 01:30:52.000
(22:78) هُوَ سَمَّىٰكُمُ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ مِن قَبْلُ

01:30:52.000 --> 01:30:57.000
This fellow here insulted Muhammad and he does not realize that before Muhammad there was life.

01:30:57.000 --> 01:31:01.000
Dr. Khalifa: He does not realize. He think life started with Muhammad. A man: He didn't answer my question.

01:31:01.000 --> 01:31:03.000
A man: He didn't answer my question. A woman: He answered your question.

01:31:03.000 --> 01:31:11.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, therefore, if you read Sura 21, verse 73, we know that the Salat and Zakat and all the duties came through Ibrahim.

01:31:12.000 --> 01:31:15.000
(21:73) وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِمْ فِعْلَ ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ وَإِقَامَ ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ وَإِيتَآءَ ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ

01:31:16.000 --> 01:31:22.000
And we see in the Quran people who did not believe. They rejected Muhammad, and they were doing the Salat and Zakat.

01:31:23.000 --> 01:31:25.000
(9:54) وَمَا مَنَعَهُمْ أَن تُقْبَلَ مِنْهُمْ نَفَقَٰتُهُمْ

01:31:25.000 --> 01:31:29.000
what prevented the acceptance of their worship...

